  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo></math><br />Let us express the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term,&nbsp;as a difference involving consecutive factorials,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo></math><br />Therefore,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br />Putting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>and adding, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>!</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>!</mo></math>"
